&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUEÑO&lt;/strong&gt; by Khadlaj — 100 ML Extrait de Parfum&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A dream too sweet to wake from. Sueño opens with a vibrant burst of raspberry — juicy, playful, and instantly addictive. The heart blooms with delicate lily of the valley and luminous orange blossom, adding an airy floral softness. The base melts into an indulgent finish of vanilla, musk, and cooked sugar — warm, creamy, and beautifully long-lasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Raspberry&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Lily of the Valley, Orange Blossom&lt;br&gt;
Base: Vanilla, Musk, Cooked Sugar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Extrait de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Women&lt;/p&gt;
